<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal retail sales rose 2.6 percent May mo/mo.</title>
<headline>Portugal retail sales rose 2.6 percent May mo/mo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's retail sales index rose 2.6 percent in May from the previous month, but retail sales were up 3.8 percent on May of 1995, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>				     May 96	   Apr 96	 May 95</p>
<p>    Index (base 1990)	   143.9	    140.3	 138.7</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
